Yeah it's probably a bad idea for contributions of small texts.


To be honest I was more interested in trialling it so it could be used for =
the bigger Lojban projects as some people should be rewarded for spending a=
 lot of their time on great projects :)


I certainly can't give anyone a salary but I just wanted to give a thank-yo=
u, to make contributors feel valuable. Like a chocolate or such, but they a=
re harder to send. It was just an idea.

